<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Nothing X App">
  <data key="d0">Nothing X App</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Nothing X App is a versatile mobile application available on both Android and iOS platforms, specifically designed to enhance user interaction and functionality across a range of Nothing audio devices, such as the Ear (open), Ear (a), Ear (2), and CMF earbuds. It provides a comprehensive suite of controls and customization options, including managing settings for active noise cancellation (ANC), equalizer adjustments, gesture controls, and dual connection functionalities. Users can also activate the Voice Assistant and personalize their audio experience through custom sound settings, bass adjustments, and Bluetooth codec options.

Available via the Google Play Store and iOS App Store, the Nothing X App enables firmware updates and synchronization for connected devices, ensuring they are always up-to-date. Additionally, it facilitates the management of notifications and device connections via Bluetooth, supporting seamless integration with mobile devices. The app serves as the official platform for managing various functionalities, allowing users to customize settings and manage features across several Nothing products, including earbuds and Buds Pro. Whether it is adjusting audio quality or configuring device functionalities, the Nothing X App provides users with robust controls to tailor their listening experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8b23107caad65d85305805a37ddbe28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a5e79a49bc7db2a612f28136aee41c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e8ce97e9623a3206989beb9bb64519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c721c853ee8f8f0dc302ae4d23208b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea28975423f6227a8330d76c202878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8202293fdace1a3a66be97a3995370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4524a05ac17de1be9923e9a9dc9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7514c9c486c31232321ac43b9689ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea3750d302ca3a5f45590d544e79cdaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebeef135007ca56eca4d845a2c04e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbdc3aa884ec77acb84402d00879691d</data>
