<node id="Nothing Support Team">
  <data key="d0">Nothing Support Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing Support Team is a customer service entity offering assistance for persistent device issues with the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Support Team is a customer service department that provides assistance for issues related to sound clarity during calls and signal stability.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Support Team provides assistance for unresolved issues with applications and devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b51e206cee412c86265f35f8120e9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e37afdf610d89a09df8901349a725e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597436</data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Support">
  <data key="d0">Customer Support</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Customer Support is a vital service entity dedicated to assisting users with a wide range of technical and application-related issues. This service is provided by organizations, including the company Nothing, and is focused on helping customers resolve problems with their products and services. Customer Support offers comprehensive assistance for unresolved issues with devices and applications, particularly when troubleshooting steps have failed. The team is responsible for guiding users through the resolution of persistent issues, including but not limited to, restoring devices to factory defaults, resetting passwords, and addressing technical concerns such as phone charging, sound, and overall functionality. They are also available to answer queries related to products like CMF earbuds and Nothing devices, ensuring that customers receive necessary support for phone and device operations. Customer Support is accessible for additional help, equipped to provide solutions for any technical inquiries or troubleshooting needs related to smartphone and application usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e598990cce04e756caad38b82dbe3eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e37afdf610d89a09df8901349a725e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcacac32b6b6cffea40cb0a17d301d61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-946e2c39d383e3255fe1b3a1508733e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9168201d4eac75ddffe0059a4394bb79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af070275f346cb3aabc6679c7791a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea3750d302ca3a5f45590d544e79cdaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522fc3ced3c136bbb28b287f215d20c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f0e791bf9a53157a462f57f05674eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
