<node id="Battery Life">
  <data key="d0">Battery Life</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery Life refers to the duration for which various devices can operate between charges, influenced by usage scenarios, audio settings, and other conditions. Specifically, the Buds Pro Earbuds can provide up to 11 hours of continuous music playback, with variations depending on ANC settings and modes of operation. Similarly, the Ear (a) performance changes with modes such as ANC ON or OFF. The CMF Buds Pro 2 offer differences in playback and talk time based on usage conditions, while the CMF Buds 2 are noted for extensive usage durations under various modes, detailing active usage and standby times contingent on the features engaged. For smartwatches, the Battery Life of the Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2 varies by usage intensity, from typical to heavy use. Furthermore, Battery Life can be maintained or extended through practices like regular charging, maintaining proper temperature, and avoiding overuse during charging, enhancing the operational duration across different devices including the Nothing earphones and Nothing Ear (open), with operational times differing greatly between music playback and communication scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbdc3aa884ec77acb84402d00879691d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-310bcdfd35de1b898e48e8659f40d35e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597508</data>
</node>
<node id="Nothing Customer Service">
  <data key="d0">Nothing Customer Service</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Customer support service for Nothing device users to address concerns and provide solutions for audio device problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service is tasked with offering support and replacements for products of the brand Nothing, specifically for charging issues with cases and earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service is the support service for Nothing products, assisting customers with troubleshooting and inquiries.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support and assistance for users of Nothing's devices, including the Ear (2).&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support and assistance to users of Nothing products, including the Nothing Ear.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea3750d302ca3a5f45590d544e79cdaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597508</data>
</node>
<node id="Nothing OS">
  <data key="d0">Nothing OS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing OS serves as the operating system for various devices in the Nothing brand, including Nothing Phone (1) and Nothing Phone (2a), and is also integrated with accessories like the Ear (a) earbuds and Ear (2). It is based on Android 14, providing a robust software platform that supports interface and feature customizations. Starting from version 1.1.4, Nothing OS offers integration of the Nothing X app in Device Details, alongside enhanced customization options for both phones and earbuds. Notably, Nothing OS facilities software updates to improve functionality and user experience across Nothing devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43c5f3a3b39a02f332e40eef921a1f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3de9a6eca983da6478af176236f5152b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-136bde614c09969c0d7fb82cc253fd47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe8e5cdde2af69f64b8ce3b5c683676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597512</data>
</node>
<node id="Bluetooth">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth is a wireless technology standard that facilitates the exchange of data and communication over short distances between both fixed and mobile devices. This technology is commonly utilized to create personal area networks, allowing seamless connectivity and interaction among a variety of devices, including electronic gadgets like CMF Earbuds, Ear (stick), Ear (1) earbuds, phones, laptops, Watch Pro, and other compatible devices. Bluetooth technology is especially important for ensuring wireless pairing and connectivity, with a typical range of up to 10 meters, enabling devices such as the Watch Pro to make and receive calls once paired with smartphones. Additionally, Bluetooth is often referenced in relation to airplane mode settings and connection issues with different devices. Its functionality extends beyond basic data transfer, offering capabilities for information sharing, updates, device syncing, and management, thereby playing a crucial role in modern wireless communication solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27081652ef7a553b2a6096008ef80269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597516</data>
</node>
<node id="Ear (2)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (2)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (2) is a model of wireless earbuds produced by Nothing, known for their advanced features and connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (2) is a pair of wireless earbuds featuring specifications such as dual connection capability, active noise cancellation, ENC, and various audio support functions like Google Fast Pair and LDAC.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (2) is a set of advanced Bluetooth-enabled earbuds designed by Nothing, featuring Dual Connection capabilities, customizable gesture controls, noise cancellation, and options for personalized sound profiles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597516</data>
</node>
<node id="Ear (a)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (a)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (a) are earbuds that offer various features such as Active Noise Cancellation, fast-charging, Dual Connection, and are water/dust resistant.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) are wireless earbuds that include features such as high-definition audio streaming, gesture controls, dual connection functionality, noise cancellation, and integration with the Nothing X App.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) is a brand of earbuds that supports custom EQ settings and various sound effects, designed to provide high-quality audio experiences for music enthusiasts.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) is a model of wireless earbuds produced by Nothing, mentioned in relation to connection and reconnection processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597516</data>
</node>
<node id="Watch Pro">
  <data key="d0">Watch Pro</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Watch Pro is a versatile and multifunctional smartwatch designed to cater to a wide range of user needs. It boasts a 340 mAh battery and is equipped with a 1.96-inch AMOLED display, providing a clear and vibrant interface. Watch Pro supports Bluetooth calling and connects to mobile devices via Bluetooth, enabling convenient call and message notifications. Additionally, it offers customizable watch faces and features for exercise and fitness tracking, including monitoring of heart rate, blood oxygen levels, sleep patterns, stress, and step count. Built with various sensors and algorithms for high accuracy, the Watch Pro is ideal for monitoring health metrics.

For added functionality, Watch Pro utilizes the CMF Watch app, which allows for display settings, music control, phone tracking, weather updates, and firmware upgrades. Users can pair the device with other tech gadgets for enriched connectivity. While the smartwatch supports a vast range of sports activities and offers customizable exercise types, it does not include NFC or eSIM capabilities. Furthermore, Watch Pro features interchangeable straps and IP68 dust and water resistance, making it a durable option for active lifestyles.

The device's ability to synchronize with the CMF Watch app is crucial for optimal performance, allowing time syncing and access to additional features such as contact list integration for displaying caller names or numbers. When specific connection issues arise, troubleshooting may be necessary to ensure seamless operation with iOS devices and other compatible smartphones. Overall, the Watch Pro stands out as a powerful accessory, merging fitness tracking with communication capabilities in a sleek wearable package.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597520</data>
</node>
<node id="CMF Watch app">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch app</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Watch app is a versatile mobile application developed to enhance and manage the functionalities of the Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2 devices. It serves as a companion tool, allowing users to connect their smartwatch to a smartphone for seamless integration and improved performance. The app facilitates customization, enabling users to manage watch faces, exercise settings, and notification preferences. Additionally, it supports health data syncing and camera remote control, providing a comprehensive smartwatch experience. Users can benefit from device upgrades, including firmware updates and volume adjustments for optimal functionality. The CMF Watch app also expands language support and manages contact lists, ensuring effective communication by displaying caller information. Through the app, users can access weather updates and other features, making it an essential tool for enhancing their smartwatch capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c1381dcd623ad5b2ea0b60f6ad95d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597523</data>
</node>
<node id="CMF Watch App">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch App</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Watch App is a mobile software application designed to pair with smartwatches, specifically the Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2, to provide enhanced user experience and functionalities. It offers a comprehensive suite of features, including managing notifications, settings customization, syncing data, upgrading firmware, and troubleshooting device issues. Additionally, the app supports tasks such as time synchronization and monitoring, and provides additional features for tracking and managing fitness activities. Users are encouraged to download the CMF Watch App to fully configure and enjoy the varied functionalities of the Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c1381dcd623ad5b2ea0b60f6ad95d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e66067604ae44825d98ba3ed45122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597525</data>
</node>
