<node id="Phone">
  <data key="d0">Phone</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A phone, possibly a smartphone, that interacts with earbuds and may experience Bluetooth connectivity issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone is a mobile communication device that connects to CMF Earbuds via Bluetooth for audio output and calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone refers to mobile devices generally discussed in the context of settings, maintenance, and data transfer.&lt;SEP&gt;The Phone is a device referenced throughout the text for functions like battery management, file restoration, and location services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0</data>
