  <data key="d2">CMF Earbuds are Bluetooth-enabled earphones with dual connection capabilities, gesture controls, and compatibility with the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;CMF Earbuds are wireless earbuds compatible with various devices and feature Bluetooth connectivity and gesture controls.&lt;SEP&gt;CMF earbuds are wireless audio devices that may encounter charging issues if not properly maintained.</data>
