  <data key="d0">Firmware Upgrade</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Firmware Upgrade involves updating the embedded software on a device to improve its performance and add new features.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware Upgrade is the process of updating the device's operating software through the Nothing X App to improve functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware Upgrade refers to the process of updating the Watch Pro's software to enhance functionality and resolve issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware Upgrade refers to updating the software on the Watch Pro via the CMF Watch app to experience the latest features.</data>
