<node id="Google Play">
  <data key="d0">Google Play</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Play is a digital distribution service designed for Android devices that serves as an online platform where users can download applications. Specifically, it offers the Nothing X app, which can be utilized to manage settings for Nothing Ear devices and Buds. As the primary store for Android apps, Google Play facilitates a variety of app downloads, including the Nothing X app, effectively supporting users in customizing their audio accessories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebeef135007ca56eca4d845a2c04e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e8ce97e9623a3206989beb9bb64519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbad053247bfe41ce192c651034259c3</data>
