  <data key="d0">Dual Connection Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual Connection Feature allows the CMF Earbuds to connect with two devices simultaneously via Bluetooth.&lt;SEP&gt;The dual connection feature allows CMF Buds Pro 2 to connect to two devices simultaneously, offering flexibility in device usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8b23107caad65d85305805a37ddbe28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f</data>
