<node id="IP54 Rating">
  <data key="d0">IP54 Rating</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The IP54 rating indicates that the Buds have a moderate level of protection against dust and water, according to the IEC 60529 standard.&lt;SEP&gt;The IP54 rating indicates the Buds Pro Earbuds' protection against dust and splashes, tested under controlled laboratory conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700</data>
