<node id="Nothing">
  <data key="d0">Nothing</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing is a consumer technology company renowned for designing and producing innovative electronic devices. The company's product lineup includes a range of tech products such as phones, earbuds, adapters, and headphones. Notably, Nothing is recognized for introducing the Glyph Interface and the Find My Phone functionality, enhancing user experience. Among its key offerings are the Nothing Phone, Nothing Ear devices, and the Phone (2a) Plus. The company is dedicated to technological innovation, as evidenced by its development of the Ear (2) earbuds and the Neckband Pro, for which it conducts comprehensive testing on battery life and charging capabilities. In addition to its product innovations, Nothing provides robust customer support and troubleshooting services for its devices, establishing a comprehensive suite of consumer support solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f522fc3ced3c136bbb28b287f215d20c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8202293fdace1a3a66be97a3995370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcde7317fc7b036415d89ea81329b232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4524a05ac17de1be9923e9a9dc9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597573</data>
</node>
<node id="IEC 60529">
  <data key="d0">IEC 60529</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">IEC 60529 is the testing standard for IP54 rating, indicating the Buds' resistance to dust and water.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597573</data>
</node>
<node id="ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)">
  <data key="d0">ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A technology integrated into Nothing earbuds, like CMF Buds Pro 2, to reduce unwanted ambient sounds, adjustable through the Nothing X App.&lt;SEP&gt;ANC is a feature in the Buds that allows for the reduction of ambient noise, enhancing the listening experience.&lt;SEP&gt;ANC is a feature in the Neckband Pro that reduces unwanted ambient sounds, enhancing the listening experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Noise Cancellation is a technology in Ear (a) that reduces unwanted environmental sound by up to 45 dB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f8202293fdace1a3a66be97a3995370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c</data>
