  <data key="d0">SBC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SBC is a standard Bluetooth codec supported by Ear (a) for basic audio streaming capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is a standard audio codec supported by Nothing Ear for Bluetooth audio streaming.&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is a subtype of digital audio encoding technology, providing standard sound quality for the earbuds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8e8ce97e9623a3206989beb9bb64519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9</data>
