  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A QR Code is available for downloading the Nothing X app, offering an alternative method to access the app via scanning.&lt;SEP&gt;QR Code provided on packaging for downloading the Nothing X app by scanning.&lt;SEP&gt;The QR Code is available on Nothing's packaging, allowing quick access to the Nothing X App download page.</data>
