<node id="ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)">
  <data key="d0">ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">ENC is a feature in the Neckband Pro designed to minimize ambient noise during calls.&lt;SEP&gt;ENC is a feature of Ear (2) that reduces background noise using the microphone, enhancing the clarity of voice transmission.&lt;SEP&gt;ENC is a technology supported by Ear (a) to minimize ambient sound during phone calls for clearer communication.&lt;SEP&gt;ENC is technology specially tuned to remove unwanted background noise during calls, ensuring clear communication.</data>
