<node id="Google">
  <data key="d0">Google</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google is a multinational technology company recognized for its expansive array of internet-related services and features. These include Google accounts, which facilitate data transfer and account management, as well as device location services like Find My Device and Find My Phone, which are crucial for tracking and locating devices. Additionally, Google offers services that enhance phone management, such as system updates and settings management, and plays a pivotal role in backup processes and access to applications via the Google Play Store. The company's services are integrated into various devices, including compatibility with the Nothing Phone, providing essential infrastructure for device connectivity and user convenience across the globe.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d866982ab2e7ced6661f8a940789dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe8e5cdde2af69f64b8ce3b5c683676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dbf1c133d4ea12599adde2c8babfb03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c73879f5f4d2c0285aa18473f689789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d82ee9e80b9a4011cc5dfdad909fc2</data>
