<node id="Camera">
  <data key="d0">Camera</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Camera is a device feature that can be accessed quickly via gestures and is used for taking photos and videos.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera app on a smartphone provides settings and options for taking photos, including geographical settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera on a device can be controlled for various features such as turning the recording light on and off.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera on the phone can be quickly accessed from the lock screen using specific gestures or button presses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1bc17eaf113f533442b214ae6b6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505</data>
