<node id="Alarm">
  <data key="d0">Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Alarm is a clock feature that allows users to set reminders and wake-up alerts with customizable settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Alarm settings on the phone allow users to set repeat times, labels, sounds, and vibration options for reminders and alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Alarms are time-based alerts set by the user to remind or wake them up, featuring customized sounds, labels, and repeat options.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1bc17eaf113f533442b214ae6b6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813</data>
