  <data key="d0">Network &amp; Internet</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Network &amp; Internet is a category in device settings where users can manage connectivity options like WiFi, mobile data, and SIM card configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;Network &amp; Internet settings allow users to manage their connectivity options including WiFi, data usage, and network type.</data>
