<node id="VoLTE">
  <data key="d0">VoLTE</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">VoLTE, which stands for Voice Over LTE, is a technology designed to facilitate high-quality voice calls over a 4G LTE network. This service enables enhanced voice and video calling capabilities, providing users with high-speed wireless communication for mobile phones. To utilize VoLTE, activation and support from network carriers are required, as well as the use of compatible devices. Additionally, certain conditions must be met to support video calling over the network. Overall, VoLTE represents a significant advancement in mobile communication, optimizing call quality and connectivity through LTE networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597577</data>
</node>
<node id="Airplane Mode">
  <data key="d0">Airplane Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Airplane Mode is a feature found on mobile devices designed to disable all wireless communications. It turns off functions such as WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular data, making it ideal for airplane travel or conserving battery life. Additionally, this setting can be toggled on or off to troubleshoot connectivity issues. By disabling these wireless functions, Airplane Mode ensures safety and compliance with regulations during flights.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fcacac32b6b6cffea40cb0a17d301d61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597579</data>
</node>
<node id="Storage">
  <data key="d0">Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage settings allow users to manage data and space on their device, optimize performance, and clear unused files.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e</data>
