  <data key="d5">1767597579</data>
</node>
<node id="24-hour System">
  <data key="d0">24-hour System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">24-hour System is a clock feature that allows time to be displayed in a 24-hour format as opposed to the 12-hour AM/PM cycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The 24-hour system is a format for displaying time, as opposed to the 12-hour system with AM/PM.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597579</data>
</node>
<node id="Battery Life Tips">
  <data key="d0">Battery Life Tips</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A series of recommendations aimed at extending a phone's battery life, including charging habits, temperature considerations, and the use of original chargers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597579</data>
</node>
<node id="Phone 1">
  <data key="d0">Phone 1</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Phone 1 is a mobile device that does not support NFC or wireless battery sharing but allows user removal and reinstallation of its case.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone 1 is a mobile device that features various capabilities like dual SIM support, 4G modes, fast charging, WiFi 6 compatibility, and both face and fingerprint unlock technologies. However, it does not support wireless charging or eSIM, and lacks a 3.5mm headphone jack.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597579</data>
</node>
<node id="Jio">
  <data key="d0">Jio</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jio is a mobile network provider that supports VoLTE services.&lt;SEP&gt;Jio is a telecommunications company that provides network services, including VoLTE, in India.&lt;SEP&gt;Jio is a telecommunications operator mentioned as a compatible network for VoLTE calls, requiring both parties to be on the same network.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b</data>
