<node id="WiFi Connection">
  <data key="d0">WiFi Connection</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A WiFi connection is necessary for setting up the Nothing phone and transferring data wirelessly.&lt;SEP&gt;A WiFi connection provides wireless Internet connectivity, necessary for transferring data between phones.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi connection is essential for transferring data and setting up a new Nothing Phone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6165e1e8378c1118b98626013d6262b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e6bb17059b6ce78b33dddb496db9d2</data>
