<node id="Game Mode">
  <data key="d0">Game Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Game Mode enhances gaming experiences on Nothing Phone by managing notifications, touch sensitivity, graphics, and activating Do Not Disturb.&lt;SEP&gt;Game Mode is a feature on the Nothing Phone that enhances gaming experiences by managing notifications and graphic settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Game Mode is a feature on the Nothing Phone that enhances gaming experiences by offering notification management, touch error prevention, and improved graphics.&lt;SEP&gt;Game Mode is a feature on the Nothing Phone that enhances the gaming experience by managing notifications and improving graphics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3de9a6eca983da6478af176236f5152b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
