</node>
<node id="Fast Pair">
  <data key="d0">Fast Pair</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast Pair is a feature for quickly connecting Bluetooth devices, like Nothing Ear, to compatible devices such as the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Pair is a feature on the Nothing Phone that streamlines the pairing process with compatible devices like Nothing Ear.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Pair is a technology used for quickly connecting the Nothing Ear earbuds with the Nothing Phone when detected.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Pair is a technology used in Nothing Phone for quickly pairing with devices like Nothing Ear.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Pair support on Ear (1) allows easy and quick pairing with Android and Chrome OS devices that are compatible.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d82ee9e80b9a4011cc5dfdad909fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597591</data>
</node>
<node id="Screen Recording">
  <data key="d0">Screen Recording</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Screen Recording is a feature that allows users to record the activity on their phone screen and save it as a video file.&lt;SEP&gt;Screen Recording is a function on the Nothing Phone that allows users to capture their phone screen activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43c5f3a3b39a02f332e40eef921a1f87</data>
