  <data key="d2">The Do Not Disturb Mode is a setting on the Watch Pro 2 that silences notifications, available in full or scheduled modes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Do Not Disturb Mode on the Watch Pro silences notifications and can be scheduled or fully activated.</data>
