  <data key="d0">Network</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Network refers to the connections enabling data exchange over digital devices, essential for functionalities such as OTA/system updates.&lt;SEP&gt;Network refers to the connectivity infrastructure that allows devices to communicate and access internet services.</data>
