<node id="Ear (1)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (1)</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (1) is a Bluetooth earbud offered by Nothing, compatible with most devices and featuring functionalities like audio and microphone control.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (1) is a pair of earbuds with features such as volume control, EQ customization, and Environmental Noise Cancellation. It can be used independently and has a battery life of up to 5.7 hours.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="Clock Widget">
  <data key="d0">Clock Widget</data>
  <data key="d1">product feature</data>
  <data key="d2">A Clock Widget on Nothing Phone is a display feature used to show time, which may need adjustments through Settings if issues occur.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="Phone (1)">
  <data key="d0">Phone (1)</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Phone (1) is a device that incorporates the Ear (1) app functionalities seamlessly once updated to Nothing OS 1.1.4 or higher.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone (1) is a smartphone that integrates with the Nothing X app to manage Ear (stick) and Ear (1) features, requiring Nothing OS 1.1.4 or higher.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone (1) refers to a mobile device that includes features such as Battery Saver, Battery Share, app pinning, and screen casting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-136bde614c09969c0d7fb82cc253fd47</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="Clear Voice (ENC)">
  <data key="d0">Clear Voice (ENC)</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Clear Voice (Environmental Noise Cancellation) is a microphone-focused noise cancellation technology that filters unwanted background noise during calls.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="USB-C charging cable">
  <data key="d0">USB-C charging cable</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The USB-C charging cable is an accessory provided with Ear (1) for charging, allowing the earbuds to fully charge in 1.5 hours.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="Qi-compatible wireless charger">
  <data key="d0">Qi-compatible wireless charger</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A Qi-compatible wireless charger can be used to charge the Ear (1) case in 2.5 hours, offering flexibility in charging methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767597611</data>
</node>
<node id="IPX4 Rating">
  <data key="d0">IPX4 Rating</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">IPX4 Rating ensures that Ear (1) earbuds are resistant to water splashes from any direction, offering durability under different conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7</data>
