<node id="WEEE Directive">
  <data key="d0">WEEE Directive</data>
  <data key="d1">regulation</data>
  <data key="d2">The WEEE Directive is followed in EU countries for the end-of-life disposal of Nothing products, promoting environmental responsibility.</data>
