<node id="Qi-certified Chargers">
  <data key="d0">Qi-certified Chargers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Qi-certified Chargers are wireless charging devices compatible with the Ear (2), offering easy and standardized charging options.&lt;SEP&gt;Qi-certified chargers are accessories that are compatible with Ear (2) for wireless charging, available at various public locations and as accessories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c</data>
