<node id="Wireless Charging">
  <data key="d0">Wireless Charging</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Wireless Charging is a technology that facilitates power replenishment without the need for cables, compatible with Qi-certified chargers. This feature is supported by Ear (2) and Phone (2), providing users with the convenience of wireless charging. Specifically, Phone (2) supports the 15W Qi standard, enabling efficient and cable-free charging. However, Wireless Charging is not supported by the Nothing Phone or the Nothing Phone (2a), which necessitates the use of traditional wired charging methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ceda8e99b5757b3aaecad74209f71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41ebb68d062de192afe8e06b1a67a1c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-281d19d9c4f252fd5c844c3d467ca398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e</data>
