  <data key="d0">IP54 and IP55 Ratings</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">IP54 and IP55 are ingress protection ratings denoting the level of water and dust resistance for the Ear (2) earbuds and charging case, respectively.</data>
