  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bass Enhance is an algorithm in Ear (a) that detects low-frequency signals to enhance bass output.&lt;SEP&gt;Bass Enhance is an algorithm that boosts low-frequency signals in audio played through the Nothing Ear earbuds, offering a more dynamic bass experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c</data>
