<node id="Ear (stick)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (stick)</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (stick) is a pair of wireless earbuds featuring advanced features like environmental noise cancellation, fast charging, and support for various Bluetooth sound codecs.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (stick) is a type of earbuds designed for comfortable and natural listening experiences, featuring a half in-ear design and compatibility with Bluetooth devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (stick) is a variant of Nothing Ear with specific features like press controls for music and calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Wireless earbuds by Nothing known for their seamless connectivity and customizable audio settings.</data>
