<node id="Google Assistant">
  <data key="d0">Google Assistant</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Assistant is a virtual assistant developed by Google, designed to allow users to perform actions and obtain information using voice commands. It is integrated into various devices to aid with task automation and enhance user experience through voice-activated features. The assistant offers seamless integration with various Google services, facilitating a cohesive interaction ecosystem. However, Google Assistant is not supported on the Nothing (2a) Phone and cannot be used to activate the Glyph interface on Nothing Phone. Overall, Google Assistant is a robust technology aimed at simplifying tasks and providing information efficiently via voice commands.</data>
