  <data key="d2">Location Services allow apps to access the device's geographic location for better functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;Location Services is a feature that must be turned on for precise location tracking on devices through Google services.&lt;SEP&gt;Location Services on a device allow apps to access location data for various functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;Location Services provides apps with access to the device's location, necessary for mapping and tracking functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Location Services refers to settings that enable apps to access a device's location data.</data>
