  <data key="d2">Dark Theme is a display setting option that inversely colors the display to darken backgrounds and lighten text for better visibility in low light.&lt;SEP&gt;Dark Theme is a display setting that changes the device's interface to a darker color scheme to ease eye strain.&lt;SEP&gt;Dark Theme is a display setting that changes the interface's color scheme to darker shades.&lt;SEP&gt;Dark Theme is a display setting that changes the phone's interface to a darker color scheme.</data>
