  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiple Users is a feature allowing the setup of different user profiles on the device, accessible from the lock screen.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple Users is a system capability that allows switching between different user profiles from the lock screen.&lt;SEP&gt;The Multiple Users feature allows different user profiles to be accessed and managed on the phone.</data>
