  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Notifications are alerts from applications that inform the user of new activities or updates, customizable through settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifications are alerts pushed from the CMF Watch app to the Watch Pro, informing users of incoming messages and calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifications are alerts that inform users of updates or messages on their device, which can be managed through settings.</data>
