  <data key="d2">Nothing Sounds offer original and customizable sounds for notifications and ringtones to personalize the device experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Sounds refers to the original set of notification sounds available on the device, used for alerts and ringtones.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Sounds refers to the original sounds available in the device for notifications and ringtones, which can be customized according to user preference.</data>
