  <data key="d2">GPS (Global Positioning System) is a satellite-based navigation system used to determine geographical locations and save location data with photos.&lt;SEP&gt;GPS (Global Positioning System) is used for acquiring location data to enhance photo settings.&lt;SEP&gt;GPS, or Global Positioning System, is used to set geo-location data for photos.</data>
