  <data key="d6">42.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Ear (open) users are encouraged to use the Nothing X App to select sound effects and customize audio quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing X App allows for software updates of the Ear (open) to ensure better performance and connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing X App is used to connect and manage Ear (open) earbuds using Bluetooth.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing X App is used to control and configure various features of the Ear (open) earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing X App supports Ear (open) by providing an equalizer and customizable sound settings to enhance audio performance.</data>
