<edge source="Watch Pro" target="CMF Watch app">
  <data key="d6">121.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch app and the Watch Pro are interconnected entities designed to enhance user experience through seamless integration. The CMF Watch app serves as a crucial tool for connecting the Watch Pro to a smartphone, enabling extended functionalities and control. This app facilitates the management and customization of the Watch Pro's features, including notifications, contact management, and device settings. Essential for ensuring optimal performance, the CMF Watch app is used to manage firmware updates for the Watch Pro, addressing potential tracking inaccuracies and improving overall functionality.

The Watch Pro requires a connection to the CMF Watch app to synchronize data, update firmware, and access enhanced features such as call notifications, health monitoring, and weather information. For full functionality, the Watch Pro must be paired with the app, which also enables customization and expanded control over device management. Through this integrated system, the Watch Pro can be managed and upgraded effectively, ensuring the watch performs at its best and provides an enriched user experience.</data>
  <data key="d8">app integration,application management,connectivity,device compatibility,device connectivity,device integration,device management,device pairing,device update,extended functionalities,feature enhancement,feature management,feature update,firmware update,firmware updates,functionality enhancement,functionality extension,software connection</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767597621</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Watch Pro" target="CMF Watch App">
  <data key="d6">63.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch App serves as a crucial companion to the Watch Pro, facilitating a range of essential functions and enhancements. It connects with the Watch Pro to manage and push notifications, ensuring seamless device management and data monitoring. The app is instrumental in handling firmware upgrades, providing necessary updates to maintain the optimal performance of the Watch Pro. Additionally, it enhances the features and functionalities of the device, particularly focusing on fitness tracking capabilities. Data synchronization between the Watch Pro and the CMF Watch App is vital for maintaining accurate information exchange. Overall, the CMF Watch App is indispensable for managing settings, updates, and enhancing the overall user experience of the Watch Pro.</data>
  <data key="d8">connectivity,device connection,device management,feature enhancement,notification management,software connection,software integration,software updates,synchronization,technology integration</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767597629</data>
</edge>
